<header class="topbar">
  <a class="topbar__brand" href="/" aria-label="Dandy home"><img src="{{ 'dandy-wordmark.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Dandy" width="96" height="36"></a>
  <a class="btn btn--sm" href="#offer">Try Mixed Berry Gummies</a>
</header>

<main>

<!-- 1. Hero -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero__media">
    <picture class="hero__plate">
      <source media="(min-width: 1900px)" srcset="{{ 'cshop-hero-wide.webp' | asset_url }}" type="image/webp">
      <img src="{{ 'cshop-hero-tall.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Berry syrup dripping down a cream wall behind the Dandy Mixed Berry pouch on a candy counter" width="1600" height="1986" fetchpriority="high">
    </picture>
    <img class="hero__giant" src="{{ 'cshop-hero-gummy.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A sugar-coated Dandy Mixed Berry gummy" width="1200" height="970" fetchpriority="high">
    <div class="hero__sparkles" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__copy">
    <h1>Kratom that tastes like candy.</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">Soft, sugar-coated Mixed Berry Gummies for anyone done with powder, capsules, and chasers.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn btn--lg" href="#offer">Try Mixed Berry Gummies</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 2. Flavor: the cost of the old ritual, then the tasting board -->
<section class="flavor" id="flavor">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="flavor__head">
      <h2>No powder mouth. No bitter chaser. No mixing ceremony.</h2>
      <p>Just a soft, sugar-coated Mixed Berry gummy that tastes genuinely good and gives you a simpler way to keep kratom in your day.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cost">
    <figure class="cost__media">
      <img src="{{ 'cshop-old-ritual.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A kitchen scale, an unwashed scoop, a cloudy glass with green residue and a used napkin on a counter" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
    <div class="cost__text">
      <h3>The part you learned to tolerate.</h3>
      <p>You’ve got a scale somewhere in a drawer. A scoop that never got washed. And a taste you’ve learned to tolerate.</p>
      <p class="cost__end" data-reveal>That’s the part <mark class="hi hi--dark">that ends.</mark></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="board" aria-label="Three things you notice about the gummy">
    <figure class="board__frame" data-reveal>
      <div class="loop board__media" data-loop="board-soft">
        <img class="loop__still" src="{{ 'cshop-board-soft-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A fingertip gently pressing a glazed, sugar-coated Dandy gummy on black wood" width="720" height="900" loading="lazy">
        <video class="loop__video" playsinline muted loop preload="none" poster="{{ 'cshop-board-soft-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" aria-label="A fingertip gently pressing a glazed, sugar-coated Dandy gummy on black wood">
          <source src="{{ 'cshop-board-soft.mov' | asset_url }}" type="video/quicktime">
          <source src="{{ 'cshop-board-soft.mp4' | asset_url }}" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
      <b class="board__word">Soft.</b>
      <figcaption class="caprow">Berry glaze over crunchy sugar.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="board__frame" data-reveal>
      <div class="loop board__media" data-loop="board-glossy">
        <img class="loop__still" src="{{ 'cshop-board-glossy-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A Dandy gummy cut in half, turned slowly so its glossy berry-red center catches the light" width="720" height="900" loading="lazy">
        <video class="loop__video" playsinline muted loop preload="none" poster="{{ 'cshop-board-glossy-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" aria-label="A Dandy gummy cut in half, turned slowly so its glossy berry-red center catches the light">
          <source src="{{ 'cshop-board-glossy.mov' | asset_url }}" type="video/quicktime">
          <source src="{{ 'cshop-board-glossy.mp4' | asset_url }}" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
      <b class="board__word">Glossy.</b>
      <figcaption class="caprow">Glossy berry center. Nothing chalky, nothing to chase.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="board__frame" data-reveal>
      <div class="loop board__media" data-loop="board-sweet">
        <img class="loop__still" src="{{ 'cshop-board-sweet-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Two hands pulling a Dandy gummy apart, berry jelly stretching between the halves" width="720" height="900" loading="lazy">
        <video class="loop__video" playsinline muted loop preload="none" poster="{{ 'cshop-board-sweet-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" aria-label="Two hands pulling a Dandy gummy apart, berry jelly stretching between the halves">
          <source src="{{ 'cshop-board-sweet.mov' | asset_url }}" type="video/quicktime">
          <source src="{{ 'cshop-board-sweet.mp4' | asset_url }}" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
      <b class="board__word">Sweet.</b>
      <figcaption class="caprow">Sugar crust outside, berry jelly inside. No bitter aftertaste.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap ugcrow">
    <div class="ugcrow__aside"><h3>The first bite usually says it.</h3><p>Someone who has used kratom for years, tasting a Mixed Berry gummy for the first time. No chaser in the frame.</p>
      <figure class="ugcrow__still"><img src="{{ 'cshop-flavor-sugar.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sugar crystals landing around a Dandy gummy on dark wood" width="1600" height="1195" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
    <figure class="ugc ugc--tilt-l" id="ugc-01" data-slot="ugc-01" data-label="UGC-01 | Existing first-bite flavor reaction">
      <div class="ugc__frame">
        {%- if section.settings.clip_01 != blank -%}
        {{ section.settings.clip_01 | video_tag: image_size: '720x', playsinline: true, preload: 'metadata', controls: false, autoplay: false, loop: false, muted: false, class: 'ugc__video' }}
        {%- else -%}
        <video class="ugc__video" playsinline preload="metadata" poster="{{ 'cshop-ugc-01-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}">
          <source src="{{ v01q }}" type="video/quicktime">
          <source src="{{ v01m }}" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        {%- endif -%}
        <img class="ugc__fallback" src="{{ 'cshop-ugc-01-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" hidden>
        <p class="ugc__cap" aria-live="off"></p>
        {{ play_button }}
        <span class="ugc__meta">UGC-01 | Existing first-bite flavor reaction</span>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. Format: the torn filmstrip -->
<section class="format" id="format">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="format__head">
      <h2>Same plant. Much easier ritual.</h2>
      <p>If you already use kratom, you already know the routine. This is the part that gets easier.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="strip">
    <div class="strip__old">
      <figure class="strip__frame">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-powder-column.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Spilled green kratom powder across a grimy counter with a crusted spoon, a sludge-ringed glass and a stained napkin" width="1280" height="1600" loading="lazy">
        <b class="strip__word" data-reveal><span>Powder</span><svg class="strike" viewBox="0 0 320 16" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9c38-5 76-4 114-3 46 1 88-4 134-2 22 1 42 2 64 4"/></svg></b>
        <figcaption class="caprow caprow--onphoto">Choke it down, then chase it with orange juice.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="strip__frame">
        <img src="{{ 'cshop-format-capsules.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A grimy hand holding a pile of dusty green kratom capsules, one cracked open" width="1280" height="1600" loading="lazy">
        <b class="strip__word" data-reveal><span>Capsules</span><svg class="strike" viewBox="0 0 320 16" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M4 9c38-5 76-4 114-3 46 1 88-4 134-2 22 1 42 2 64 4"/></svg></b>
        <figcaption class="caprow caprow--onphoto">Hard to swallow. Chalky, dusty, and a lot of them.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <figure class="strip__new" data-reveal>
      <img src="{{ 'cshop-format-gummy.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A hand holding a Dandy gummy with the pouch in an open desk drawer behind" width="1280" height="1600" loading="lazy">
      <b class="strip__word strip__word--new"><mark class="hi">Gummies</mark></b>
      <figcaption class="caprow caprow--dark">Grab one. Enjoy the flavor. Keep moving.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap ugcrow ugcrow--loop">
    <div class="ugcrow__aside">
      <h3>The old routine, then the new one.</h3><p>The spoon, the glass and the napkin leave the desk. The pouch and one gummy take their place.</p>
      <figure class="loop loop--wide" data-loop="format">
        <img class="loop__still" src="{{ 'cshop-loop-format-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="The Dandy pouch and one gummy on a cleared desk" width="720" height="396" loading="lazy">
        <video class="loop__video" playsinline muted loop preload="none" poster="{{ 'cshop-loop-format-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" aria-label="Powder, spoon and glass slide out of a desk scene and the Dandy pouch with one gummy slides in">
          <source src="{{ l_format_q }}" type="video/quicktime">
          <source src="{{ l_format_m }}" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <figure class="ugc ugc--tilt-r" id="ugc-02" data-slot="ugc-02" data-label="UGC-02 | Existing powder-to-gummy format switch">
      <div class="ugc__frame">
        {%- if section.settings.clip_02 != blank -%}
        {{ section.settings.clip_02 | video_tag: image_size: '720x', playsinline: true, preload: 'metadata', controls: false, autoplay: false, loop: false, muted: false, class: 'ugc__video' }}
        {%- else -%}
        <video class="ugc__video" playsinline preload="metadata" poster="{{ 'cshop-ugc-02-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}">
          <source src="{{ v02q }}" type="video/quicktime">
          <source src="{{ v02m }}" type="video/mp4">
