        <img class="ugc__fallback" src="{{ 'cshop-ugc-02-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" hidden>
        <p class="ugc__cap" aria-live="off"></p>
        {{ play_button }}
        <span class="ugc__meta">UGC-02 | Existing powder-to-gummy format switch</span>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4. Mechanism: LIFT / FOCUS / SETTLE as type -->
<section class="mech" id="mechanism">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mech__head">
      <h2>The same plant can meet you in more than one place.</h2>
      <p>Kratom is dose-dependent. Smaller amounts tend to produce energy and focus. Larger amounts lean toward body ease and relaxation. The amount is printed on the pouch, so you know what you are taking.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mech__stage" data-state="lift">
    <figure class="mech__loop loop" data-loop="mechanism">
      <img class="loop__still" src="{{ 'cshop-loop-mechanism-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="One Dandy gummy on a saucer" width="720" height="406" loading="lazy">
      <video class="loop__video" playsinline muted loop preload="none" poster="{{ 'cshop-loop-mechanism-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}" aria-label="One Dandy gummy moving through a bright morning, a focused desk and a warm evening">
        <source src="{{ l_mech_q }}" type="video/quicktime">
        <source src="{{ l_mech_m }}" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
      <span class="mech__label" aria-hidden="true"><b data-for="lift">Lift</b><b data-for="focus">Focus</b><b data-for="settle">Settle</b></span>
      {{ sparkles }}
    </figure>
    <div class="belt" aria-hidden="true"><div class="belt__stripes"></div><div class="belt__marker"></div></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="states states--type" role="tablist" aria-label="Three parts of the day one pouch can fit. An explanation, not a dosing guide.">
        <button class="state" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-state="lift"><b>Lift</b><small>Smaller amounts</small><p>For the mornings when you want to get moving.</p></button>
        <button class="state" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-state="focus" tabindex="-1"><b>Focus</b><small>In between</small><p>For the hours when you want to stay with the thing in front of you.</p></button>
        <button class="state" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-state="settle" tabindex="-1"><b>Settle</b><small>Larger amounts</small><p>For when the day is done and your body knows it.</p></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="mech__line"><mark class="hi">One pouch</mark> can fit a brighter morning, a focused afternoon, or a slower evening at home.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap ugcrow">
    <div class="ugcrow__aside ugcrow__aside--still">
      <figure class="ugcrow__still ugcrow__still--wide"><img src="{{ 'cshop-day-social.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Dandy pouch on a picnic table in the afternoon sun" width="1600" height="1986" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
    <figure class="ugc ugc--tilt-l" id="ugc-04" data-slot="ugc-04" data-label="UGC-04 | Existing one-pouch, different-moments story">
      <div class="ugc__frame">
